eo to confirm that have `data` as `LocalVector` to convert on return is worth it here, as opposed to making it `Vector` from the start (I see it's resized quite a bit so I suppose the current approach is a good option).","created_at":"2025-06-13T08:29:03Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T08:29:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#discussion_r2144486178","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107469","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144486178"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#discussion_r2144486178"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107469"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144486178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":104,"original_line":104,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144493442","pull_request_review_id":2923860530,"id":2144493442,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_0l-C","diff_hunk":"@@ -239,7 +239,7 @@ void AudioStreamMP3::set_data(const Vector<uint8_t> &p_data) {\n }\n \n Vector<uint8_t> AudioStreamMP3::get_data() const {\n-\treturn data;\n+\treturn Vector<uint8_t>(data);","path":"modules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.cpp","commit_id":"abe3b481aea7ef7fa88fa7230743d7f415786635","original_commit_id":"b63645c6b1287e5166e1bed1923d8a3d22f46313","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We do this in the codebase sometimes, where we store `LocalVector` internally but expose `Vector` interfaces.\r\nThe reason is that `Vector` still has considerable overhead, even on lookup. If we expect user queries to happen rarely, but internal read/writes to occur often, this type of interface is still preferable, even though we're re-allocating for user queries.","created_at":"2025-06-13T08:33:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T08:33:13Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#discussion_r2144493442","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107469","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144493442"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#discussion_r2144493442"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107469"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144493442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":242,"original_line":242,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2144482388,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pu